<!-- CoreX themed-icon (monochrome) mark; Android tints it with the wallpaper palette. One tint, so
     the X is drawn solid inside an outlined diamond rather than knocked out: overlapping strokes in
     a single colour cannot leave a seam, which an even-odd hole would at the X's crossing point. -->
